              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *itŭ nalla pāṭṭāṇŭ*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "nallathāṇŭ, then pāṭṭāṇŭ, and hear that neither gains a letter",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *nallathāṇŭ*, then *pāṭṭāṇŭ*, and hear that neither gains a letter]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is a song? (പാട്ട് (pāṭṭŭ).) What slides in before ആണ്? (Nothing — പാട്ടാണ്.) And why not? (It ends in the half-u, not a full vowel.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ML-C99-paaduka",
      "sequence": 3530,
      "title": "പാടുക (pāṭuka) — to sing",
      "headword": "പാടുക",
      "romanization": "pāṭuka",
      "gloss": "to sing — a verb whose noun is beside it rather than inside it",
      "script": "malayalam",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
