              "instruction": "nṛtthaṁ",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *nṛtthaṁ*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "itŭ nalla nṛtthamāṇŭ",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *itŭ nalla nṛtthamāṇŭ*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "pāṭṭāṇŭ, then nṛtthamāṇŭ",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *pāṭṭāṇŭ*, then *nṛtthamāṇŭ*]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is dance? (നൃത്തം (nṛtthaṁ).) What does its ം become before ആണ്? (മ — നൃത്തമാണ്.) And does the m sound change? (No — only its writing.)"
            }
