                "ends in: അ. word: കഥ. joined to ആണ്: കഥയാണ് (kathayāṇŭ)."
              ]
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "That is the whole chapter in three words. പാട്ട് (pāṭṭŭ) gives a sound up, നൃത്തം (nṛtthaṁ) re-spells one, and കഥ (katha) takes a letter in — three endings, three outcomes, and you were told each one before you met the word it lands on."
            }
