              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is a story? (കഥ (katha).) കഥ (katha) ends in അ — what slides in before ആണ്? (യ — കഥയാണ്.) Which word you already had does the same? (സിനിമ — സിനിമയാണ്.)"
