              "text": "A song, dance, a story? (പാട്ട് (pāṭṭŭ), നൃത്തം (nṛtthaṁ), കഥ (katha).) Which of the three gives a sound up before ആണ്? (പാട്ട് (pāṭṭŭ) — it ends in the half-u.) And which adds one? (കഥ (katha) — it ends in അ, so a യ comes in.)"
